The Bass Re-Tard (BRT) is a highly-secure application developed by the Bass
Tard Corporation to support remote system administration. The BRT code has
been analyzed by a number of security experts and it is considered to be free
from any vulnerability. Formal verification with a number of analysis tool was
also performed. The analysis found no vulnerabilities.

Feel free to install the code on your system and send us an email to let us
know your success story. We will conatct you (or your BRT application) soon!







